  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A giant of stacked basalt in the old quarry below Kilnhold. A fist cone and a ground quake that throws everyone near it. At 60% it raises basalt columns out of the ground (they stay — and they are cover) and then roars across the whole quarry: hide behind a column. At 30% it starts to crumble: chunks fall on everyone and the columns rise faster.",
